This directory vendors OdinLink-Five userspace only (the RCCL net plugin and
libodl_tb5). The kernel driver odl_tb5.ko is licensed under GPL-2.0 and is
not included here; obtain it from https://github.com/Geramy/OdinLink-Five.

Headers under nccl/ are copied from the in-tree RCCL net plugin example and
retain their upstream NVIDIA copyright (BSD / Apache-2.0 as marked in each
file). See projects/rccl/LICENSE.txt and the per-file headers.
